附录 · English Summary (reference only, not legally binding)

This project is source-available, NOT open source.

  - Free for personal, non-commercial use only.
  - Commercial use of any kind requires a separate written license from the author.
  - Redistribution, republishing, or packaging for distribution is prohibited
    (a personal fork on a hosting platform that keeps this license intact is allowed).
  - The memory subsystem under `vendor/symvolve_memory/` is closed-source and shipped
    only as a compiled/encrypted runtime. Reverse engineering it is prohibited.
  - Watermarks/fingerprints must be preserved in any derivative work; removing or
    forging them is a material breach.
  - No third-party model weights, TTS/RVC models, or artwork assets are bundled;
    users must obtain them independently under their own licenses.
  - Use for training machine-learning models or building published datasets is prohibited.
  - Contributing grants the author a perpetual, irrevocable, freely sublicensable license.
  - Provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind; author is not liable for any damages.

